<h4>Progressor</h4><p class="who">Defender · inspired by Fernando Hierro</p>
<p class="desc">A modern centre-back capable of stepping out of the backline to start attacks with progressive passing.</p>
<div class="bars"><div class="bar"><span class="bl">Pace</span><span class="bt"><span class="bf s2" style="left:55.0%;width:28.3%"></span></span><span class="bv">73 → 90</span></div><div class="bar"><span class="bl">Ball Control</span><span class="bt"><span class="bf s3" style="left:48.3%;width:43.3%"></span></span><span class="bv">69 → 95</span></div><div class="bar"><span class="bl">Passing</span><span class="bt"><span class="bf s2" style="left:36.7%;width:50.0%"></span></span><span class="bv">62 → 92</span></div><div class="bar"><span class="bl">Scoring</span><span class="bt"><span class="bf s1" style="left:30.0%;width:48.3%"></span></span><span class="bv">58 → 87</span></div><div class="bar"><span class="bl">Defending</span><span class="bt"><span class="bf s4" style="left:58.3%;width:36.7%"></span></span><span class="bv">75 → 97</span></div><div class="bar"><span class="bl">Physical</span><span class="bt"><span class="bf s3" style="left:48.3%;width:45.0%"></span></span><span class="bv">69 → 96</span></div></div>
<div class="meta"><div><h5>Perks</h5><ul><li><strong>Restarter</strong> — Quick restarts after winning the ball launch immediate attacks.</li><li><strong>Goalkeepers Favourite</strong> — Improved link-up with your keeper for safe build-up play.</li></ul></div>
<div><h5>Specializations</h5><ul><li><strong>Progressor+</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Fernando Hierro</span></li><li><strong>Pioneer</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Franz Beckenbauer</span></li><li><strong>Janitor</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Rio Ferdinand</span></li></ul></div></div>
